Phase 4 (Synthesis) complete. `done: true`.

**Headlines:**

- **165 → ~103 DCYs/migrant** (central revised, -38%; range 92-115)
- Migrant-only floor: ~38-44 DCYs (stripping all remittance/spillover)
- **Overstatement concentrates in the remittance channel**: spillover multiplier (1.65x→1.25x), remittance rate (9%→7%), and households (2.0→1.3) together account for ~85% of the downward revision
- Destination income, counterfactual, and attribution are all **defensible** — modest adjustments only
- **The CE case is a bet on loan repayment**, not on DCY magnitude: at near-zero net cost (loans repaid), even 30 DCYs/migrant clears the bar; at $5K net cost, the revised $49/DCY is marginal vs the ~$40 GiveWell bar; at $10K net cost, it fails
- Rec: **fund but re-price** — anchor headline to ~100-110, collect actual remittance data, price on revolving fund economics
